{
  "$comment": "Hand-maintained from the repos.yaml entry (E9-P2 trivial-tier) while blocked-until-jake-ok: onboard refuses public repos without jake_ok. Re-run onboard after Jake OKs. Guards injected (not listed); provenance-emit waits on all foundations (O1).",
